            <title>[LU-20208] Allow rustreapi documentation to be generated by docs.rs</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20208</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The Rust API added with &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19561" title="Add Rust interface  for lustreapi and lnetconfig" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19561"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19561&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; needs some tweaks in order for the `cargo doc` command to work in environments without a full Lustre build. One such example is &lt;a href="https://docs.rs/about/builds" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;docs.rs&lt;/a&gt;[,|https://docs.rs/about/builds],] which can automatically generate documentation for crates published on &lt;a href="https://crates.io/" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;crates.io.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
